@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title L3 受控工具运行层组件图
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 100

rectangle "L1 业务Activity适配 / PEP" as L1 LC_EXTERNAL
package "L3 Controlled Tool Runtime" LC_ADAPTER {
  component "ToolRegistry" as REGISTRY
  component "ToolCatalogRouter" as CATALOG
  component "ToolCallRuntime" as RUNTIME
  component "ToolExecutionGuard" as GUARD
}
rectangle "Security Plane" as SEC LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "L4 Execution Runtime" as L4 LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "Artifact / Repository Ports" as INFRA LC_INFRASTRUCTURE
rectangle "Operations Plane" as OPS LC_OPERATIONS

L1 --> RUNTIME : BND-L13-001\nAuthorizedToolRequest
RUNTIME --> CATALOG : 冻结 Tool Route
RUNTIME --> GUARD : 执行前检查
GUARD --> SEC : PermitValidationPort\nconsume / authorizeStart
RUNTIME --> L4 : BND-L34-001\nGuard通过后单次派发
L4 -[norank,dashed]-> RUNTIME : ToolResult
CATALOG --> REGISTRY : 固定版本与当前可用状态
REGISTRY --> INFRA : 注册视图读写约束
RUNTIME --> INFRA : Artifact受控读写
RUNTIME -[norank,dashed]-> L1 : ToolOutcome / lateFactSink
RUNTIME ..> OPS : BND-OPS-001

note bottom of GUARD
  Guard 不重新进行策略裁决；
  只验证一次性 Permit 与执行请求仍匹配。
end note
@enduml
